SCICHEM 3.4 in the hazbrief models image (HB-167 Part B item 8)
=================================================================

What this image holds of SCICHEM: two executables built from source (runsci, scipp), seven shared
libraries built from the same source, and one data file (sciData/landuse_scichem.dat). They were built
in this image from EPRI's repository at commit 156625eff47923d232dbe4f6d055707ea3bf6ff1
(https://github.com/epri-dev/SCICHEM, committed 2025-10-23), with eleven patches
(patches/ (held privately), each with its reason in docs/evidence/hb165/probe/why.tsv) and the
build flags in deploy/models/scichem/build_engine.sh. The source of every byte is that commit and those
patches; the image is built locally from them and is not distributed as a binary.

